Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.02,0:00:03.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}生旅雅虎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.02,0:00:03.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs50}（应该是指亲临现场的那种观光节目，但也能理解成人生之旅）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.36,0:00:06.22,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是什么特集呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.63,0:00:12.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴上次和阿翼一起看那个恐龙特集 非常投入呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.09,0:00:13.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.62,0:00:15.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:16.63,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:19.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,说起来 阿翼他人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:24.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 他好像在阅读蓝天大地的国王送过来的书
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:24.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Skyland
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:32.17,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.84,0:00:36.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 我们去下面房间玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:37.81,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:42.34,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.07,0:00:49.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼他好像有想要研究的东西 最近很热衷学习
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.65,0:00:51.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 太可靠了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.89,0:00:53.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这周的特集是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.75,0:00:56.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结婚仪式！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.31,0:00:58.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 结婚仪式啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.86,0:01:02.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,新娘子的婚纱真漂亮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.52,0:01:06.59,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:10.20,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.37,0:01:13.14,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 小空兴趣浓厚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:14.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好美丽！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.11,0:01:22.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这边世界的结婚仪式太闪亮了 真浪漫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.34,0:01:26.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？蓝天大地的结婚仪式是不是跟这里不一样？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.24,0:01:29.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 比如在我们村
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.44,0:01:36.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是新郎和新娘 先用全村都能听到的音量 大声呐喊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.96,0:01:38.21,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.54,0:01:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好 我们结婚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:47.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,闻声而来的村民们就集合起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.75,0:01:51.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,跳一整晚的舞来庆祝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.71,0:01:53.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这种的也很有趣啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.07,0:01:56.08,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,结婚 是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.51,0:02:01.55,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 结婚啊 就是彼此喜欢的两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.78,0:02:06.79,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,约定以后都永远要好 吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:08.24,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.14,0:02:16.92,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.21,0:02:20.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜你们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.62,0:02:21.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.35,0:02:27.60,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空要和翼结婚！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.82,0:02:29.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.25,0:02:30.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.33,0:02:32.05,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,要结婚！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.26,0:02:33.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.14,0:04:12.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}要好♡\N小空结婚仪式☆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.97,0:04:17.20,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我和公...公主结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.58,0:04:18.95,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,结婚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.24,0:04:22.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,因为小空很喜欢阿翼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.29,0:04:25.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈 不过现在结婚还太早了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:26.77,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.36,0:04:30.02,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主这份心 我是很荣幸的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:35.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我来当公主的结婚对象... 实在是诚惶诚恐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:38.01,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不要 就要结婚！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.67,0:04:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新郎新娘就要携手切开蛋糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.35,0:04:46.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇... 好大的蛋糕啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:52.00,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,对对 大到必须新郎新娘一起切开
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.64,0:04:53.85,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.01,0:04:54.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.02,0:05:01.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空是不是也想穿上那么漂亮的礼服 再享受美味的蛋糕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.81,0:05:03.56,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,礼服和蛋糕？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:08.59,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这个我懂 我小时候也有模仿过结婚仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.99,0:05:11.08,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.28,0:05:15.56,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那么就不是结婚仪式 而是办一个模仿派对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.61,0:05:20.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想体验一下这边世界的结婚仪式！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.46,0:05:23.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就玩一次结婚仪式游戏吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.81,0:05:25.30,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这个主意很有趣呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.67,0:05:27.25,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,少年同意的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.56,0:05:30.81,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 只要公主高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.73,0:05:33.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.86,0:05:34.87,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.04,0:05:37.31,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,马上开始准备！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.09,0:05:51.78,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 少年读书很卖力呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.36,0:05:56.12,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这本上记载了很多见所未见的天空石
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.36,0:05:56.12,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1380,960)}Sky Jewel
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:06:00.02,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,只要认真学习 就能为国效力的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.41,0:06:06.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,离蛋糕出炉还有一点时间 阿翼你就继续看书吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.77,0:06:09.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我这边的准备也快要完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.45,0:06:11.83,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.06,0:06:14.65,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就恭敬不如从命 继续读书了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.87,0:06:20.52,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.75,0:06:31.25,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的 等结婚仪式准备好了 阿翼就会回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:35.56,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.39,0:06:42.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空真可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:46.01,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,唔 少年 放松 放松！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.47,0:06:49.52,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,能... 能不能别让我更紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.03,0:06:55.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空和阿翼弟弟啊 能够发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.08,0:06:58.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后也不放弃彼此喜欢的感情吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.51,0:07:01.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,当然不会！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.73,0:07:03.49,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,永远要好！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:10.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都站好了 再靠近一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.31,0:07:14.51,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好 大伙一起来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:15.51,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,飞扬！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（快门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.71,0:07:35.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好美妙的结婚仪式啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:38.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！让我想要按照蓝天大地的习俗 一直跳到早上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.25,0:07:40.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻嘻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.59,0:07:42.68,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我们也该收拾收拾了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.91,0:07:44.04,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:44.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.82,0:07:45.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.63,0:07:46.66,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:49.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.39,0:07:50.87,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,结婚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.03,0:07:51.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.99,0:07:52.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.01,0:07:54.15,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.33,0:07:57.88,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,结婚了 就要永远在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.13,0:08:02.43,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,结婚 我们这不是模仿结婚仪式的派对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.62,0:08:03.82,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:10.04,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是当真认为这是真的结婚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.24,0:08:11.37,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.54,0:08:14.11,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.64,0:08:22.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到 公主居然是当真的...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.75,0:08:24.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我也能理解小空的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.14,0:08:29.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,因为电视上的新娘子很幸福啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.49,0:08:30.51,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:37.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,只要睡一晚 小空的结婚仪式也会结束的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.33,0:08:38.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧 小蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.97,0:08:48.10,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.11,0:08:49.16,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:54.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 没什么 小空可太可爱了 有点神魂颠倒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.55,0:08:57.16,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这一点是不需要有疑问...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.38,0:09:07.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结.... 结结... 结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.35,0:09:12.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我那可爱无比的小空公主居然出嫁了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.98,0:09:15.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我会同意吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:18.40,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,呀... 不是的... 听我说...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.61,0:09:26.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最重要的是 你有肩负起蓝天大地的王的觉悟吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.53,0:09:28.19,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,觉悟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.50,0:09:31.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼 你怎么又闯大祸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:35.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白的 我能理解你的想法 小翼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:38.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是妈妈觉得现在就结婚还是太早了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.15,0:09:42.04,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的 你们听我说啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.02,0:09:46.67,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空和翼结婚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.93,0:09:52.65,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.71,0:09:56.56,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,呜 呜...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.91,0:10:01.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我能挑起的担子...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.24,0:00:00.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.22,0:10:16.97,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,起来 阿翼 起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.35,0:10:20.59,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.25,0:10:23.40,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.11,0:10:38.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 睡了个懒觉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.77,0:10:39.82,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.49,0:10:43.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,没了！书没了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:44.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.15,0:10:48.77,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,没有了 国王陛下给我的宝贵的书
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.00,0:10:50.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.48,0:10:53.12,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得 昨天是放在这椅子上的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:55.50,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 之后再没有动过
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:10:58.41,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 大伙分头找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:10:59.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(280,1060)}是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:10:59.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(680,1060)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.47,0:11:02.17,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦大伙了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:11.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 没有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.48,0:11:15.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,少年 你是不是起夜迷糊了 把书放到二楼房间里去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.19,0:11:17.60,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不会 没这种事的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.97,0:11:18.85,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.05,0:11:23.60,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,吵到你了啊 公主 我们正在找东西...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.21,0:11:28.46,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 公主有见到过放在椅子上的书吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.89,0:11:29.92,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.93,0:11:33.70,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是国王陛下给我的书
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.87,0:11:36.36,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 不知道什么书！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.72,0:11:38.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？小空 这个是！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.24,0:11:41.05,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,才没有藏起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.21,0:11:42.81,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.17,0:11:46.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主！你不要跑啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.23,0:11:47.07,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不要不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.39,0:11:50.63,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:53.15,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不要！不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.48,0:11:56.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,没想是被小空拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.03,0:12:03.30,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊啊... 那是对我很宝贵的书
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.59,0:12:04.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,请还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.27,0:12:07.90,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,翼... 宝贵的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.09,0:12:11.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是非常非常宝贵！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:14.10,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,噗...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.84,0:12:17.06,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:19.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.82,0:12:20.46,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.64,0:12:21.51,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:23.75,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,超讨厌 翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.96,0:12:25.13,CureMaj,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs70}超讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.38,0:12:26.63,CureMaj,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs60}超讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.92,0:12:28.25,CureMaj,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs50}超讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.15,0:12:28.16,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.73,0:12:31.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.99,0:12:35.35,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.53,0:12:40.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天才玩的结婚仪式游戏 今天就被讨厌了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.79,0:12:43.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,莫名其妙的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.33,0:12:45.37,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你是完全不懂呢 少年
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:47.65,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,反正我就是个少年
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.83,0:12:50.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我问你 你觉得小空为什么要把书藏起来？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.22,0:12:55.02,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么 嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.08,0:12:59.47,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你最近挺帅的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.69,0:13:00.57,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.76,0:13:02.51,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,拼了命的学习
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.72,0:13:05.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,向着自己的目标勇往直前
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.89,0:13:08.41,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢夸张
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.57,0:13:11.54,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空就有点孤单了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.74,0:13:12.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:19.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是感觉到 一直陪着自己玩的阿翼在渐渐远离？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.54,0:13:23.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.74,0:13:25.04,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.55,0:13:28.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧 少年
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.12,0:13:30.69,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,蝶华姐...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.90,0:13:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（钟声）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.54,0:13:43.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噼噼噼 噼噼噼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.14,0:13:53.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}《熊孩子》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.06,0:13:55.58,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空好无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:56.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.10,0:13:59.41,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更要好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.94,0:14:02.57,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.84,0:14:04.70,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,永远要好！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:08.36,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才想要结婚...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.86,0:14:11.87,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,可我却压根没有察觉到...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.61,0:14:16.60,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.79,0:14:18.70,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.88,0:14:19.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.45,0:14:22.77,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,让你感受孤单了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:25.28,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,翼...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.47,0:14:26.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咕咕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.37,0:14:31.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咕咕 咕咕 咕咕！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.70,0:14:33.47,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.33,0:14:38.63,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,一人之下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.21,0:14:47.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量 召唤
