Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.51,0:21:09.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.71,0:21:18.08,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,翼...？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.31,0:21:19.52,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,在此起誓
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.69,0:21:25.59,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我将担负骑士的责任 永远守护天空公主
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.02,0:21:31.29,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,以后也要一起到处玩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.05,0:21:40.55,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,翼...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.86,0:21:43.13,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.59,0:21:45.81,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,真白...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.37,0:21:48.64,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,蝴蝶...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.69,0:21:52.57,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,永远一起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.57,0:21:55.78,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,永远要好
