Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.57,0:22:09.07,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.57,0:22:09.07,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1090,970)}威爱愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.83,0:22:13.52,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 要和我一起跳哦！
